Abstract = {This article presents a dataset recorded with a sensor-equipped research
   vehicle on public roads in the city of Coventry in the United Kingdom.
   The sensor suite includes a monocular-, infrared-and smartphone-camera,
   as well as a LiDAR unit, GPS receiver, smartphone sensors and vehicle
   CAN bus data logger. Data were collected by day and night in a variety
   of traffic, weather and road surface conditions with a focus on the
   correlation between vehicle dynamics and the environmental perception
   process of automated vehicles. (C) 2019 The Author(s). Published by
